#: fd908c10360f4be3a81ea5dbf47f9ea3
msgid ""
"The dedicated RC input is on the RCIN pin and supports all unidirectional RC"
" protocols. For bi-directional protocols such as CRSF/ELRS, any suitable "
"serial port can be configured with ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 23`` and the "
"receiver connected to that port's TX/RX pins. See `RC control systems "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/common-rc-systems.html>`__ for protocol-"
"specific setup details."
msgstr ""
"专用 RC 输入位于 RCIN 引脚，支持所有单向 RC 协议。对于 CRSF/ELRS 等双向协议，可将任一合适的串口配置为 "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 23``，并把接收机连接到该串口的 TX/RX 引脚。各协议的具体设置详情见 `RC 控制系统 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/common-rc-systems.html>`__。"

